m very  aware of as as we go through this  process but i think brutal honesty  uh should be a way to to navigate those  concerns  well your morning shift is over you can  check the box on your schedule for today  1 p.m eastern answer stupid questions  for 20 minutes  and now you can go to your afternoon  routine coach congratulations on the  award from last year and the success of  the team all the best in the off season  we look forward to talking again soon  thanks mike i appreciate it hi i'm mike  tarico and thanks for watching  make sure to hit subscribe for the  latest news and highlights  from nbc sports
 

